usage: nanomonsv [-h] [--version]
                 {parse,merge_control,get,validate,insert_classify,connect}
                 ...

positional arguments:
  {parse,merge_control,get,validate,insert_classify,connect}
    parse               Parse supporting reads for candidate structural
                        variations
    merge_control       Merge control panel files from parse results
    get                 List up reliable structural variations with refined
                        breakpoint positions
    validate            Validate GenomonSV format SV list using nanopore
                        sequence reads
    insert_classify     Classify long insertion into LINE1, Alu, SVA, and so
                        on
    connect             Connect called SVs by support reads

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
